<title>HONG KONG: Top Form plunges 9 pct after resumption.</title>
<headline>Top Form plunges 9 pct after resumption.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top Form International Ltd plunged 9.0 percent or 2.5 cents to HK$0.25 when trading resumed on Monday after a week's suspension pending an announcement related to an unstated interim loss.</p>
<p>The impact of the understatement on unaudited interim results amounted to about HK$3.7 million, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the understatement was not considered to be material in the context of the unaudited interim results with respect to the loss of HK$68.3 million announced in March.</p>
<p>Trading was thin at 554,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 2843 6369</p>
